     the Bryllim register as institutional sans-serif body, not pixel
     bitmap. text-wrap: balance so "Quantitative Researcher" never
     breaks weirdly on mid-width viewports. */
  .hero-flagship__name {
    font-family: var(--j-ff-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.2vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  /* v13.1 Bryllim parity : subhead. Sits below the H1 as the
